    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄω</span></b>  (C), 
			Ep.
		
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμεναι</span>: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.818
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.281
				</span></i>
			, inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆσαι</span> (v. infr.): aor. 2
			subj.
			1pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕωμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.402
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				Ep.
			
			3sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄᾰται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					101
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆται: πληροῦται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.717
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.307
				</span></i>
			:—<i>satiate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος ἆσαι Ἄρηα</span>
			<i>to give</i> him <i>his fill of</i> blood, <i><span class="en">
				5.289
			</span></i>: but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly
			intr., <i>take one's fill of</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱεμένη χροὸς ἄμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.70
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιλαιομένη χροὸς ἆσαι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				168
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.317
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόοιο μὲν ἔστι καὶ ἆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.157
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσεσθε κλαυθμοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.717
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτῆτος ἄσασθαι φίλον ἦτορ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.307
				</span></i>
			. (Root <i>sā: s[schwa],</i> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ-ατος, ἅ-δην.</span>)</div>
